[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11462.23, "timestamp": "03:11:02", "text": "不。哦，是的。谁摧毁了这一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11465.429, "timestamp": "03:11:05", "text": "我们的基地？早上6点之前一切都很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11470.55, "timestamp": "03:11:10", "text": "当天。那是一条鱼。他放置了TNT炸药，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11474.389, "timestamp": "03:11:14", "text": "男人。在我面前。他把它放好，然后他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11478.55, "timestamp": "03:11:18", "text": "在我面前炸毁了基地。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11480.23, "timestamp": "03:11:20", "text": "什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11481.99, "timestamp": "03:11:21", "text": "是的。他当时说：“我会做的。”我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11490.429, "timestamp": "03:11:30", "text": "伙计，那……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11496.23, "timestamp": "03:11:36", "text": "宠物？我的天啊。我相信等待是可以的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11499.87, "timestamp": "03:11:39", "text": "你喜欢第三人称射击游戏吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11503.75, "timestamp": "03:11:43", "text": "呃，我正在对你做OP。你知道的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11505.83, "timestamp": "03:11:45", "text": "对吧，上帝？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11511.349, "timestamp": "03:11:51", "text": "呃，不。我的天啊。好的。呃，随便吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11513.429, "timestamp": "03:11:53", "text": "你想做什么都可以。即使是你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11517.19, "timestamp": "03:11:57", "text": "你可以和任何你想玩的朋友一起玩。哇。"}]